  "title": "India's Drought and El Niño Impact in South Peninsular Region",
  "summary": "Tamil Nadu and Maharashtra are expected to face drought, with reports indicating relief measures are being announced. Meanwhile, India faces a critical energy crisis due to increased crude supply from Russia and West Asia, which are under threat as global markets struggle with supply disruptions.",
