      "title": "Tamil Nadu may encounter El Niño differently from rest of India",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/energy-and-environment/tamil-nadu-may-encounter-el-nino-differently-from-rest-of-india/article71537825.ece",
      "description": "In strong El Niño years, pressure differences between the Bay of Bengal and the Arabian Sea can drive moist air into coastal Tamil Nadu; when an El Niño coincides with warmer waters in the Bay, evaporation increases, and cyclonic circulations in November-December release this stored heat as intense, localised rainfall",
